<title>MEXICO: Mexico update of U.S. soybean imports to Aug 21.</title>
<headline>Mexico update of U.S. soybean imports to Aug 21.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Soybean Association updated Friday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico. Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending   Accum Total   Week Ending   Accum Total</p>
<p>    13/07/95	 1,526,000     16/07/96	   N/A</p>
<p>    20/07/95	 1,557,000     24/07/96	2,368,000</p>
<p>    03/08/95	 1,645,000     31/07/96	2,402,000</p>
<p>    24/08/95	 1,772,000     21/08/96	2,573,000</p>
<p>    31/08/95	 1,845,000     30/08/96	   N/A</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530.</p>
</text>
